        <Abstract>Reporting point where the forecasted probability to exceed a 20 year (purple), 5 year (red), 2 year (yellow) return period is &gt; 20 %. Numbers denote the percentage of ensemble members exceeding the specific return period. Shape denotes rising (upward triangle), decreasing (downward triangle), or stagnant (circle) trend of the ensemble mean discharge within the forecast horizon.</Abstract>
